/// origin rests 1.84 m up; the span, 17.53 m, is drawn only. The mass is the team lead's operating 14,900 kg: 11,321 kg
/// empty (Wikipedia) and a CAS load between it and the 13,782 kg gross. INERTIAS, ESTIMATE: the F/A-18F's (`fighter_shape`)
/// by the mass ratio 0.677 and the length's square for pitch and yaw, and the span's square for roll, where the straight
/// wing and the nacelles well out on the fuselage are.
