/// under the main tyres, 2.00 m under the thrust line, to the fin's top 1.78 m over it, so the origin is 1.89 m over that
/// ground BUILT LEVEL. It rests tail down at its three-point rake (`roll_a_taildragger`, `spawn_vehicle`). Half the
/// fuselage's width with a margin, 0.50 m; the span, 11.286 m printed, is drawn only. THE MASS, 4,300 kg (9,480 lb), is
/// the weight AN 01-60JE-1's stall table is printed at (9,500 lb), between Wright Field's 9,760 lb test and the 9,000 lb
/// normal gross: full ammunition and most of the internal fuel. Its inertia is its planform's (`planform_of`).
